{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Guard Ninja 是一款手機防盜警報工具，適合在火車、機場或公共場所休息時使用，也可放在行李、錢包或手提電腦上作為周邊物品的防護。當手機被移動或有人嘗試拿走物品時，應用會發出警報，讓使用者及時反應。原價 US $0.99，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-71.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂防盜警報</h2>\n<p>Guard Ninja 讓使用者建立個人化警報，可按情境選擇聲音、燈光或震動，亦可混合使用；再調整手機移動靈敏度，決定何時觸發警報。使用者可設定啟動與解除計時器，爭取時間放置手機，並以自訂密碼解除警報。警報清單會顯示於主畫面，方便隨時選用合適設定。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-493-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-494-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-495-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-496-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-497-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Guard Ninja</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/guard-ninja/id1475364676?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T12:23:09.240627+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:16:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T21:38:16.009830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:28.971421+00:00","content_hash":"9ea018a016dace92145cd3989c3ccf02a998468f1500ddd441a5936e6a0465d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}